.SH NAME
blast-graph - Show the dependency graph around a file


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBblast graph  [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Show what a file imports (dependencies) and what imports it
(dependents), one level in each direction.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for graph

.PP
\fB--json\fP[=false]
	output machine-readable JSON

.PP
\fB-o\fP, \fB--output\fP=""
	write the report to this file instead of stdout


